## Milestone 5 — Frontend Payment Integration
**Goal:** Wire up the customer-facing payment flow in the frontend
**Estimated effort:** ~4–6 hours

### Tasks

#### 5.1 — Install Razorpay Checkout SDK
Load via CDN in the customer checkout page:
```html
<script src="https://checkout.razorpay.com/v1/checkout.js"></script>
```

#### 5.2 — Implement `initiatePayment(orderId)` function
```
On "Pay Now" button click:
    1. Generate idempotencyKey = `${orderId}-${Date.now()}-${uuid()}`
       → Store in sessionStorage (for recovery on reload)
    2. POST /api/payments/razorpay/order
       → { orderId, idempotencyKey }
    3. If 200/201 → open Razorpay Checkout with returned razorpayOrder
    4. On Checkout success callback → POST /api/payments/razorpay/verify
    5. On Checkout failure callback → POST /api/payments/razorpay/reconcile-failure
    6. On success → redirect to success screen
    7. On failure → show retry option (if attemptsRemaining > 0)
```

#### 5.3 — Implement recovery on page reload
```
On page load (order status screen):
    1. GET /api/payments/order/:orderId/attempts
    2. Check paymentState in response:
       - "PAID" → show success screen
       - "PENDING" / "PROCESSING" → show "Payment in progress" + resume option
       - "RETRY_AVAILABLE" → show retry button
       - "ATTEMPTS_EXHAUSTED" → show "Contact restaurant" message
       - "AWAITING_PAYMENT" → show Pay Now button
```

#### 5.4 — Build success screen
- Show order token number.
- Show order items summary.
- Show estimated preparation time.
- Link to order tracking page.

#### 5.5 — Build failure/retry screen
- Show clear error message.
- Show remaining attempts count.
- Retry button (starts new attempt with new idempotencyKey).
- "Contact restaurant" fallback when attempts exhausted.

### Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Full payment flow works end-to-end in browser (manual test).
- [ ] Page reload during payment resumes correctly.
- [ ] Success screen shows correct token number.
- [ ] Retry works after failure with a new idempotencyKey.
- [ ] Attempts exhausted state shows correct message.

